# ── .NET / Dafny build artifacts ────────────────
# bin/* ignores build output but the repo ships source launchers there:
# bin/ward (POSIX) and bin/ward.cmd (Windows) — re-include them explicitly.
bin/*
!bin/ward
!bin/ward.cmd
obj/
*.deps.json
*.pdb
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.csproj.nuget.*
project.assets.json

